<h1 class='doclevel'>1.Test Suite : miir3562_IntT</h1>
<div><p>Se testează cele 4 cazuri de testare Mockito.</p>
</div><a name="toc_tc30785"></a><p>&nbsp;</p><div> <table class="tc" width="90%" ><tr><th colspan="4">Test Case P234-68: TC01_StocService_Unitary_Success&nbsp;<span style="font-size: 80%;">[Version  : 1]</span></th></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Author:</span></td><td colspan="3">vvir3656</td></tr>
<tr><td colspan="4"><span class="label">Summary:</span><br /><p>Testarea unitară a metodei&nbsp;add&nbsp;din&nbsp;StocService. Se verifică dacă fluxul de execuție este corect atunci c&acirc;nd datele sunt valide: se apelează validarea și apoi salvarea &icirc;n repository. Toate componentele externe (Validator, Repository, Entitate) sunt mock-uite.</p>
</td></tr><tr><td colspan="4"><span class="label">Preconditions:</span><br /><ul>
	<li>Componenta&nbsp;StocService&nbsp;este injectată cu mock-uri pentru&nbsp;Validator&nbsp;și&nbsp;Repository.</li>
	<li>Mock-ul pentru&nbsp;Repository&nbsp;este configurat să returneze obiectul primit la salvare.</li>
</ul>
</td></tr><tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Execution type:</span></td><td colspan="3">Automated</td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Estimated exec. duration (min):</span></td><td colspan="3"></td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Importance:</span></td><td colspan="3">Medium</td></tr>
<tr><td colspan="4"></td></tr><tr><td > name of the autotest class:</td><td  colspan = "3" >drinkshop.service.StocServiceTest</td></tr>
<tr><td > name of the test method:</td><td  colspan = "3" >drinkshop.service.StocServiceTest#testAddStoc_Success</td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Requirements</span><td colspan="3">miir3562_F01:  AdaugareProdus [Version : 1]<br />miir3562 _F02:  CautareProdus [Version : 1]<br /></td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Keywords:</span></td><td colspan="3">&nbsp;None<br/></td></tr>
</table>
</div>
<a name="toc_tc30787"></a><p>&nbsp;</p><div> <table class="tc" width="90%" ><tr><th colspan="4">Test Case P234-69: TC02_StocService_Unitary_ValidationFail&nbsp;<span style="font-size: 80%;">[Version  : 1]</span></th></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Author:</span></td><td colspan="3">vvir3656</td></tr>
<tr><td colspan="4"><span class="label">Summary:</span><br /><p>Testarea unitară a gestionării erorilor &icirc;n&nbsp;StocService. Se verifică dacă, &icirc;n cazul &icirc;n care&nbsp;Validatorul&nbsp;aruncă o excepție, aceasta este propagată corect și metoda de salvare din&nbsp;Repository&nbsp;<strong>nu</strong>&nbsp;mai este apelată.</p>
</td></tr><tr><td colspan="4"><span class="label">Preconditions:</span><br /><ul>
	<li>Componenta&nbsp;StocService&nbsp;este configurată cu mock-uri.</li>
	<li>Mock-ul&nbsp;stocValidator&nbsp;este programat să arunce&nbsp;ValidationException&nbsp;la apelul metodei&nbsp;validate.</li>
</ul>
</td></tr><tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Execution type:</span></td><td colspan="3">Automated</td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Estimated exec. duration (min):</span></td><td colspan="3"></td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Importance:</span></td><td colspan="3">Medium</td></tr>
<tr><td colspan="4"></td></tr><tr><td > name of the autotest class:</td><td  colspan = "3" >drinkshop.service.StocServiceTest</td></tr>
<tr><td > name of the test method:</td><td  colspan = "3" >drinkshop.service.StocServiceTest#testAddStoc_ValidationFails</td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Requirements</span><td colspan="3">miir3562_F01:  AdaugareProdus [Version : 1]<br />miir3562 _F02:  CautareProdus [Version : 1]<br /></td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Keywords:</span></td><td colspan="3">&nbsp;None<br/></td></tr>
</table>
