<a name="toc_tc30789"></a><p>&nbsp;</p><div> <table class="tc" width="90%" ><tr><th colspan="4">Test Case P234-70: TC03_StocService_IntegrationV_Success&nbsp;<span style="font-size: 80%;">[Version  : 1]</span></th></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Author:</span></td><td colspan="3">vvir3656</td></tr>
<tr><td colspan="4"><span class="label">Summary:</span><br /><p>Testarea integrării dintre&nbsp;StocService&nbsp;(S) și&nbsp;StocValidator&nbsp;(V). Se verifică dacă un obiect valid trece de validatorul real și ajunge să fie trimis către repository (care este Mock).</p>
</td></tr><tr><td colspan="4"><span class="label">Preconditions:</span><br /><ul>
	<li>StocService&nbsp;este instanțiat folosind un validator real.</li>
	<li>StocRepository&nbsp;este configurat ca obiect de tip Mock.</li>
	<li>Obiectul&nbsp;Stoc&nbsp;(Mock) este configurat să returneze valori valide (ID &gt; 0, Nume != null, Cantitate &gt; StocMinim).</li>
</ul>
</td></tr><tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Execution type:</span></td><td colspan="3">Automated</td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Estimated exec. duration (min):</span></td><td colspan="3"></td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Importance:</span></td><td colspan="3">Medium</td></tr>
<tr><td colspan="4"></td></tr><tr><td > name of the autotest class:</td><td  colspan = "3" >drinkshop.service.StocServiceStep2VTest</td></tr>
<tr><td > name of the test method:</td><td  colspan = "3" >drinkshop.service.StocServiceStep2VTest#testAddStoc_IntegrationV_Success</td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Requirements</span><td colspan="3">miir3562_F01:  AdaugareProdus [Version : 1]<br />miir3562 _F02:  CautareProdus [Version : 1]<br /></td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Keywords:</span></td><td colspan="3">&nbsp;None<br/></td></tr>
</table>
</div>
<a name="toc_tc30791"></a><p>&nbsp;</p><div> <table class="tc" width="90%" ><tr><th colspan="4">Test Case P234-71: TC04_StocService_IntegrationV_Fail&nbsp;<span style="font-size: 80%;">[Version  : 1]</span></th></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Author:</span></td><td colspan="3">vvir3656</td></tr>
<tr><td colspan="4"><span class="label">Summary:</span><br /><p>Verificarea integrării dintre&nbsp;StocService&nbsp;și&nbsp;StocValidator&nbsp;&icirc;n cazul unui scenariu negativ. Testul confirmă că validatorul real detectează datele invalide și oprește execuția &icirc;nainte ca repository-ul să fie apelat.</p>
</td></tr><tr><td colspan="4"><span class="label">Preconditions:</span><br /><ul>
	<li>StocService&nbsp;utilizează instanța reală a&nbsp;StocValidator.</li>
	<li>StocRepository&nbsp;este Mock.</li>
	<li>Obiectul&nbsp;Stoc&nbsp;este configurat să returneze un ID invalid (ex: -1) pentru a declanșa logica de validare reală.</li>
</ul>
</td></tr><tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Execution type:</span></td><td colspan="3">Automated</td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Estimated exec. duration (min):</span></td><td colspan="3"></td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Importance:</span></td><td colspan="3">Medium</td></tr>
<tr><td colspan="4"></td></tr><tr><td > name of the autotest class:</td><td  colspan = "3" >drinkshop.service.StocServiceStep2VTest</td></tr>
<tr><td > name of the test method:</td><td  colspan = "3" >drinkshop.service.StocServiceStep2VTest#testAddStoc_IntegrationV_Fail</td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Requirements</span><td colspan="3">miir3562_F01:  AdaugareProdus [Version : 1]<br />miir3562 _F02:  CautareProdus [Version : 1]<br /></td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Keywords:</span></td><td colspan="3">&nbsp;None<br/></td></tr>
</table>
